The rule library (data/rules/rules_en.json) encodes construction-safety
requirements as paraphrased English summaries derived from national, industry,
and Shenzhen local standards, plus engineering- and accident-report-derived
rules. The Apache-2.0 license covers this repository's code and data
representation; it does not assert rights over the underlying regulatory
standards themselves, which remain the property of their issuing bodies. No
verbatim standard document is redistributed here. See "Licensing, provenance,
and redistribution" in README.md.
